empts. Please try again later.","wrong_password":"The current password is wrong.","same_password":"Choose a new password that’s different from the current one.","invalid_github_login":"This is not a valid GitHub username.","github_user_not_found":"There is no GitHub user with this name.","github_account_taken":"Another user signs in with this GitHub account.","invalid_rules":"A sign-up rule needs a GitHub organization name.","invalid_rule_role":"A sign-up rule can only give the editor or viewer role.","rule_org_not_installed":"The GitHub App has to be installed on the organization of a sign-up rule.","not_invited":"You don’t have an account here. Ask your admin to add you.","method_disabled":"Signing in with GitHub is turned off.","access_denied":"The sign-in was cancelled.","github_app_not_set_up":"Sveltia CMS Additions is not connected to GitHub yet. Ask your admin to finish the setup.","invalid_tenant_id":"The site ID must be 1 to 32 lower-case letters, digits and hyphens, and can’t be “default”.","invalid_tenant_name":"The site name must be up to 100 characters.","tenant_exists":"A site with this ID already exists.","github_app_missing":"No GitHub App is set up yet.","invalid_private_key":"The file is not a valid private key.","private_key_mismatch":"GitHub doesn’t accept this private key for the app. Make sure you generated it in the app’s settings.","github_error":"GitHub responded with an error. Please try again later.","data_key_locked":"Sveltia CMS Additions can’t be used until an admin finishes changing its admin secret.","not_configured":"Sveltia CMS Additions is not configured properly. Ask your admin for help.","origin_not_allowed":"This site is not allowed to use Sveltia CMS Additions. Ask your admin to add it to the allowed domains.","not_set_up":"Sveltia CMS Additions is not connected to GitHub yet. Ask your admin to finish the setup.","temporary_password":"Your password has been reset. Sign in with your username and the temporary password your admin